---
import SolutionPage from '../../../layouts/SolutionPage.astro';
import EmailCapture from '../../../components/EmailCapture.astro';
---

<SolutionPage
  title="Grounding"
  parent="Mitigate"
  oneliner="Humans evolved in constant electrical contact with the earth. Modern life has eliminated it entirely — and the biology notices."
  slug="environment-grounding"
  canonicalPath="/solutions/environment/grounding"
  showSolutionPath={false}
  showDisclaimer={false}
>
  <!-- ── Why This Matters ── -->
  <h2>Why This Matters</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>Grounding (earthing) transfers free electrons from the earth's surface into the body, where they act as natural antioxidants neutralizing positively-charged free radicals that drive inflammation and oxidative stress</li>
    <li>For virtually all of human history this contact was continuous — modern life has eliminated it almost entirely via rubber soles, elevated structures, and synthetic flooring</li>
    <li>Peer-reviewed research has documented measurable effects on inflammatory markers, cortisol rhythm, wound healing rate, and sleep quality — the intervention is real, and the barrier is only inconvenience</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- ── Featured Products — E-Commerce Hero ── -->
  <h2 class="section-eliminate">Featured Products</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Protocol-matched grounding products for daily and sleep use. Affiliate relationships disclosed below.</p>
  <div class="product-grid product-grid-2col">

    <!-- 1. Grounding Sleep Mat -->
    <article class="product-card" id="grounding-sleep-mat">
      <div class="product-badge">Flagship Pick</div>
      <h3 class="product-name">4M Grounding Sleep Mat</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">$99–$179 <span class="price-note">launch pricing finalizing</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">Bedroom-size conductive mat that plugs into your outlet's ground port — 7–8 hours of passive earthing every night.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>Conductive carbon + silver fabric — direct body contact through standard bed sheet</li>
        <li>Plugs into the ground port of any standard outlet — no special wiring</li>
        <li>Queen/king sizing; works under a fitted sheet or directly on the mattress</li>
        <li>Includes ground continuity tester and replacement cord</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">Sleep is the longest uninterrupted period available for grounding — 7 hours of passive electron transfer without any behavioral change required. Published research on grounding during sleep shows the most consistent cortisol normalization and inflammatory marker reduction of any earthing modality.</p>
      <a href="#notify-grounding" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

    <!-- 2. Grounding Floor Mat -->
    <article class="product-card" id="grounding-floor-mat">
      <div class="product-badge">Gateway Pick</div>
      <h3 class="product-name">4M Grounding Floor Mat</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">$59–$89 <span class="price-note">launch pricing finalizing</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">Desk and standing-desk version — barefoot grounding during work hours without changing your routine.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>24" x 36" conductive mat — fits under any desk or standing-desk surface</li>
        <li>Plugs into standard outlet ground; included cord with current-limiting resistor</li>
        <li>Easy-clean surface — wipes down in seconds</li>
        <li>Pairs with any barefoot or sock use; no special footwear required</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">For men who work seated or standing for 6–8 hours daily, the desk mat delivers grounding passively throughout the workday — stacking the anti-inflammatory benefit on top of sleep mat use rather than replacing it. More hours grounded = compounding benefit.</p>
      <a href="#notify-grounding" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

    <!-- 3. Grounding Patches -->
    <article class="product-card" id="grounding-patches">
      <div class="product-badge">Gateway Pick</div>
      <h3 class="product-name">4M Grounding Patches</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">$19/pack <span class="price-note">launch pricing finalizing</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">Adhesive conductive body patches — targeted contact for injury sites, travel, or extended indoor periods without mat access.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>20 patches per pack — single-use conductive adhesive pads</li>
        <li>Designed for foot arches, wrists, or areas of chronic inflammation</li>
        <li>Connects to grounding cord or mat lead</li>
        <li>Travel portable — no outlet required when used with outdoor ground rod (included)</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">Patches make grounding available anywhere — in hotels, when mats aren't accessible, or for precision placement over an inflamed joint or injury site. At $19 per pack they're the lowest-barrier entry into the protocol and an essential travel companion for members who maintain the protocol on the road.</p>
      <a href="#notify-grounding" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

    <!-- 4. Grounding Pillowcase -->
    <article class="product-card" id="grounding-pillowcase">
      <h3 class="product-name">4M Grounding Pillowcase</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">$39–$59 <span class="price-note">launch pricing finalizing</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">Head and neck targeted grounding — conductive pillowcase for members who want contact closest to the brain during sleep.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>Silver-thread conductive weave — standard pillowcase dimensions, fits queen and king</li>
        <li>Attaches to grounding mat cord or standalone ground cord</li>
        <li>Machine washable; retains conductivity through 150+ washes</li>
        <li>Antimicrobial silver content — reduces pillowcase bacterial load naturally</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">The head and neck are the highest-priority grounding target from a brain-health standpoint — proximity to neural tissue means any electron-mediated anti-inflammatory effect is most relevant here. Pairs with the sleep mat for full-body + head-targeted coverage.</p>
      <a href="#notify-grounding" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

    <!-- 5. Grounding Sheet Set -->
    <article class="product-card" id="grounding-sheet-set">
      <div class="product-badge">Insider Pick</div>
      <h3 class="product-name">4M Grounding Sheet Set</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">$129–$219 <span class="price-note">launch pricing finalizing</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">Full-bed earthing — fitted sheet + flat sheet in silver-thread conductive fabric for maximum surface-area contact during sleep.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>Fitted sheet + flat sheet set — complete above and below coverage</li>
        <li>5% silver-thread content — 20+ dB RF attenuation as secondary benefit</li>
        <li>Available queen and king; 400-thread-count equivalent softness</li>
        <li>Single grounding cord connection — plug into outlet ground once</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">The sheet set provides the largest possible contact surface for passive overnight grounding — front, back, and sides simultaneously — while also providing EMF shielding at the body surface. It's the intersection of the grounding and EMF protocols in a single product.</p>
      <a href="#notify-grounding" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

    <!-- 6. Outdoor Earthing Sandals -->
    <article class="product-card" id="earthing-sandals">
      <h3 class="product-name">4M Outdoor Earthing Sandals</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">$79–$129 <span class="price-note">launch pricing finalizing</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">Copper-soled sandals that maintain earth contact while protecting your feet — grounding-compatible outdoor footwear.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>Pure copper sole insert — conductive pathway through to the earth surface</li>
        <li>Durable natural rubber outer sole with copper contact points at heel and ball</li>
        <li>Sizes 7–14 men's — full size run</li>
        <li>Compatible with concrete, soil, grass, and sand surfaces (not asphalt)</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">Barefoot is optimal — but in many environments it's not practical. The copper-soled sandal is the next best option: maintained earth contact at both heel and forefoot while protecting against terrain hazards. Outdoor grounding time compounds with sleep and desk mat use.</p>
      <a href="#notify-grounding" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

    <!-- 7. Grounding Bands -->
    <article class="product-card" id="grounding-bands">
      <h3 class="product-name">4M Grounding Bands</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">$29/pack <span class="price-note">launch pricing finalizing</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">Wrist and ankle conductive bands — portable grounding for sedentary periods, travel, and supplement-to-mat protocols.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>2 bands per pack — wrist and ankle in one kit</li>
        <li>Conductive stainless-steel mesh interior — comfortable for extended wear</li>
        <li>Connects to grounding cord or mat lead</li>
        <li>Adjustable velcro fit — one size fits most</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">Grounding bands let you stay connected during desk work, TV time, or travel without standing on a mat. Wrist placement is practical during computer use; ankle placement during seated or reclined rest. Stacks with mat use to extend total daily grounding hours without adding any active time.</p>
      <a href="#notify-grounding" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

  </div>

  <!-- ── Notify Me Capture ── -->
  <div class="notify-capture-block" id="notify-grounding">
    <h3 class="notify-capture-heading">Get Notified When These Launch</h3>
    <p class="notify-capture-sub">Enter your email — we'll notify you when any product on this page becomes available.</p>
    <div class="notify-checkboxes">
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="grounding-sleep-mat" checked> 4M Grounding Sleep Mat</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="grounding-floor-mat" checked> 4M Grounding Floor Mat</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="grounding-patches" checked> 4M Grounding Patches</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="grounding-pillowcase"> 4M Grounding Pillowcase</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="grounding-sheet-set"> 4M Grounding Sheet Set</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="earthing-sandals"> 4M Outdoor Earthing Sandals</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="grounding-bands"> 4M Grounding Bands</label>
    </div>
    <EmailCapture source="env-grounding-notify" buttonLabel="Notify Me →" placeholder="your@email.com" />
  </div>

  <!-- ── Deeper Protocol ── -->
  <h2>The Deeper Protocol</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>Wearing rubber-soled shoes exclusively — the most universal insulator between humans and earth</li>
    <li>Living and working on upper floors or synthetic flooring with no bare-ground contact</li>
    <li>Never spending time on grass, soil, sand, or natural water without footwear</li>
    <li>Urban-only lifestyle with no access to natural ground surfaces in daily routine</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Fix sequence: 20+ minutes barefoot on natural ground daily (free — grass, soil, sand, concrete all work; asphalt and patio pavers do not) →
    grounding mat under your desk during work hours → grounding sleep mat or sheet set for passive overnight contact →
    patches for travel or targeted inflammation sites. Each layer adds hours-under-ground and compounds the anti-inflammatory benefit over time.
  </p>

  <a href="/blog/eliminate-the-insulting-behavior-environment" class="blog-deepdive-btn">
    Read More: Full Environmental Protocol →
  </a>

  <p style="margin-top:1.5rem; font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--text-light);">
    <em>Affiliate disclosure: My4MLife may earn a commission on purchases made through product links on this page. All products are independently evaluated against the My4MLife protocol standards before inclusion.</em>
  </p>

  <!-- ── Optional Protégé footer ── -->
  <div class="protege-card">
    Want personalized guidance on your environmental protocol? <strong>Become a Protégé free</strong> — the My4MLife App walks you through environmental optimization week by week.
    <a href="https://app.my4mlife.com" class="protege-link">Join My4MLife →</a>
  </div>
</SolutionPage>

<style>
.section-sub {
  color: var(--text-light);
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  margin: -0.5rem 0 1.25rem;
}

.product-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  margin: 1rem 0 2.5rem;
}
.product-grid-2col {
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
}
@media (min-width: 700px) {
  .product-grid-2col {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}
.product-card {
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.5rem 1.6rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.55rem;
  transition: border-color 0.18s, box-shadow 0.18s, transform 0.18s;
}
.product-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,184,148,0.14);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}
.product-card--bundle {
  border-color: rgba(0,184,148,0.4);
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-soft) 80%, rgba(0,184,148,0.05) 100%);
}
.product-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent);
  background: rgba(0,184,148,0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,184,148,0.3);
  padding: 0.18rem 0.6rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  align-self: flex-start;
}
.product-badge--bundle {
  color: #e67e22;
  background: rgba(230,126,34,0.1);
  border-color: rgba(230,126,34,0.3);
}
.product-name {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.product-price-range {
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text);
  margin: 0;
}
.price-note {
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--text-light);
}
.product-tagline {
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text);
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.45;
}
.product-specs {
  margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
  padding-left: 1.1rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.2rem;
}
.product-specs li {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: var(--text-light);
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.product-why {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin: 0 !important;
  line-height: 1.5;
  flex: 1;
}
.notify-btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 0.6rem;
  padding: 0.48rem 1.2rem;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: none;
  align-self: flex-start;
  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
}
.notify-btn:hover {
  background: var(--accent-dark);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

/* Notify Me capture block */
.notify-capture-block {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,54,93,0.05) 0%, rgba(0,184,148,0.07) 100%);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,184,148,0.25);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem;
  margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
}
.notify-capture-heading {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
}
